WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.618 --> 00:00:08.701
- [Voiceover] (foreign language)

00:02:19.954 --> 00:02:21.635
- Well, when you buy from local guys,

00:02:21.635 --> 00:02:23.414
it comes back to ya,

00:02:23.414 --> 00:02:25.296
and you know you're getting a local fish,

00:02:25.296 --> 00:02:28.713
it's sustainable, that's an honest thing.

00:02:32.543 --> 00:02:33.376
Thank you.

00:02:39.895 --> 00:02:43.396
- Sometimes we forget that
we are part of the ecosystem.

00:02:43.396 --> 00:02:45.215
We are animals too,

00:02:45.215 --> 00:02:48.548
and we are very ignorant, very ignorant.

00:02:52.163 --> 00:02:55.080
(foreign language)

